---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IE', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' });
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Kilkenny Power Washing"
  description="How Kilkennypowerwashing.ie collects, uses and protects your personal data, and how it is shared with our vetted local contractor."
  canonical="https://kilkennypowerwashing.ie/privacy"
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 md:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            This privacy policy applies to kilkennypowerwashing.ie (the "site"). The data controller is the
            operator of kilkennypowerwashing.ie. You can contact us at{' '}
            <a href="mailto:kilkennypowerwash@gmail.com" class="text-primary underline">kilkennypowerwash@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. What data we collect</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Information you give us</strong> through the contact/quote form: name, phone number, email, town, the service you need, and any notes you add.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data</strong>: IP address, browser type, pages visited (only if you accept analytics cookies).</li>
            <li><strong>Cookies</strong>: see our <a href="/cookies" class="text-primary underline">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. How we use your data</h2>
          <p>We use your data to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Pass your enquiry to our vetted local power washing contractor so they can give you a quote.</li>
            <li>Reply to direct queries.</li>
            <li>Improve the site (only with your analytics consent).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Lawful basis</h2>
          <p>
            We rely on your <strong>consent</strong> (Article 6(1)(a) GDPR) when you tick the consent box on the
            form. You can withdraw consent at any time by emailing us.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Sharing your data with a third-party contractor</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Important:</strong> kilkennypowerwashing.ie is a lead-generation service. When you submit the
            form, your details are passed to a single vetted, fully-insured local power washing contractor in County
            Kilkenny who will contact you to arrange a quote. The contractor's identity will be disclosed on first
            contact.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We do not sell your data. We do not pass it to multiple contractors, marketing lists, or unrelated third
            parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">6. Data retention</h2>
          <p>
            Lead form submissions are retained for <strong>12 months</strong> from the date of submission, after
            which they are deleted. Anonymised analytics may be retained for longer.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">7. Your rights</h2>
          <p>Under the GDPR you have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Access the personal data we hold about you.</li>
            <li>Request correction or deletion of your data.</li>
            <li>Request data portability.</li>
            <li>Object to or restrict processing.</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent at any time.</li>
            <li>
              Lodge a complaint with the{' '}
              <a href="https://www.dataprotection.ie/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="text-primary underline">
                Data Protection Commission
              </a>{' '}
              (the Irish DPC).
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">
            To exercise any of these rights, email{' '}
            <a href="mailto:kilkennypowerwash@gmail.com" class="text-primary underline">kilkennypowerwash@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">8. Security</h2>
          <p>
            We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your data. No system is 100% secure,
            but we take it seriously.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top will reflect any changes.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
